  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Energy Sector Management Assistance Programme (ESMAP) is a global technical assistance partnership administerd by the WB since 1983. ESMAP&#xb4;s mission is to promote the role of energy in poverty reduction and economic growth. Focus: energy security, renewable energy, energy-poverty, market efficiency and governance. www.esmap.org Continuation : 71500225</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Energy Sector Management Assistance Programme (ESMAP) &#xe4;r ett globalt program som sk&#xf6;ts av V&#xe4;rldsbanken sedan 1983. ESMAP&#xb4;s roll &#xe4;r att verka f&#xf6;r energi f&#xf6;r att minska fattigdom och &#xe5;stadkomma ekonomisk tillv&#xe4;xt. Fokus : energis&#xe4;kerhet, f&#xf6;rnybar energi, energi-fattigdom, marknadseffektivitet och styrning. www.esmap.org Forts&#xe4;ttning: 71500225</narrative>
  </description>
